# Paths Dodona leaves out when syncing this repository to the judge's files
# directory, which is copied into the sandbox for every submission. Only
# run is read at judging time, and Dodona requires config.json next to it.
# Patterns are rsync exclude patterns, anchored to the repository root.
# See https://github.com/dodona-edu/dodona/issues/8763

/tests/
/devel/
/.github/
/README.md
